        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O7xH9W",
          "name": "Body",
          "fill": "$graphite",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.3.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\nStates of the one screen; each starts from the filled screen and sits under its step: 3 · Filling in (view menu, reading failed, note, five photos, kind changed) and 4 · Sending (missing key, design failed).\n3. SCREENS\n- Photo reading failed: the tag reads \"¿Qué vista?\" and the person picks it; no retry (the photo is still sent)\n- Choosing a photo's view: the tag opens a menu — Frente, 3/4, Lateral, Interior, Uniones; the chosen one in amber-soft (selection, K6)\n- Five photos, the limit: the add tile disappears; \"5 de 5\" next to \"Fotos\"\n- Design failed, retry: reconstructFailed() above the actions, with \"Reintentar\" and \"Ver qué pasó\" (src/application/useCases/copy.ts)\n- Missing API key: missing() (src/ports/Preferences.ts) + \"Configurar\", neutral (K6); \"Analizar\" disabled\n- Writing a photo note: the note opens under its photo as a TextArea with focus\n- Kind changed, measures kept: measures the person touched stay; untouched ones re-fill with the new kind's typical\nKIT GAPS\nrust-soft (the error box is bg-rust/10 in code) · Field (0.3.0)\nNEW COPY\n\"¿Qué vista?\", \"5 de 5\", \"Son tus medidas: se quedan aunque cambies el tipo.\"",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "pbD1d",
